From 079c5e3d8f941d33390667c15acc51a1fd03644f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Saunders <cgrantsaunders@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 21:10:38 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Port OmniGroup frameworks for macOS 27 / Xcode 27 / arm64

Backported from upstream OmniGroup (origin/HEAD, 2022) where available:
- ColorSync: replace dead Carbon ColorSync APIs with ColorSyncProfileRef;
  OAColorSpace.{h,m} -> OAColorSpaceManager.{h,m}
- OAFeatures.h: OA_USE_COLOR_MANAGER now 0 on 10.11+, where the Carbon externs are gone
- OFMessageQueue, OFAlias: take upstream versions (ARC conversion; Carbon require -> if/goto)
- NSObject-OFExtensions: drop -bundle instance method (collides with -[IFBundle bundle],
  which returns CFBundleRef); callers use +bundle, as upstream does

Local fixes where upstream had diverged too far to backport:
- OBRuntimeCheck: make the debug-only runtime sweep opt-in via OBPerformRuntimeChecks=1.
  Introspecting every class corrupts process state on modern macOS -- afterwards
  [NSImage size] crashes inside LaunchServices (_LSCopyLocalDatabase). The existing
  skip-list ("classes that asplode") is the same whack-a-mole; the system now has more.
- OQColor.h: import CoreGraphics explicitly; it no longer arrives via NSGeometry.h
- OIInspectorRegistry: cast [NSApp delegate] to id for informal-protocol selectors
- OBUtilities.h: add OBFinishPortingWithNote shim for backported sources
- OAContext{,PopUp}Button: __weak ivar -> plain assign (MRC files; modern clang
  rejects __weak without ARC)
- NSColor-ColorSyncExtensions: OBPerformPosing block -> +performPosing (this
  OmniBase predates OBLoadAction)
- FixStringsFile: disable self-test; modern genstrings emits UTF-16+BOM that the
  tool's parser predates. Pre-existing failure, no app target uses it.
